# main-allowlist — the gateway's allowed destinations, one host[:port]
# per line.
#
# EMPTY by design: with no entries the gateway denies everything
# (fail-closed starter). Grow it with:
#   egresslock allow main <host>[:<port>]
# or hand-edit this file and re-run: egresslock ensure main
#
# Note: entries are HOSTNAMES the gateway resolves (squid dstdomain).
# Literal IPs and CIDR ranges are not accepted here — see main.conf's
# rule shapes (allow-host takes a hostname or IPv4 literal).
